# 5) Add temporal positional encodings
# 6) Run temporal Transformer self-attention either with standard PyTorch MultiheadAttention
#    or FlashAttention (if installed and enabled)
# 7) Train a simple one-step-ahead forecasting model in PyTorch Lightning
